  L('m2c1-3', 'm2c1', 'Data types',
`• **Numerical (quantitative)**: continuous (income, return) or discrete counts (number of late payments).
• **Categorical (qualitative)**: **nominal** with no order (sector, country) or **ordinal** with an order (credit rating AAA > AA > A).
